The following Lemma is useful:
\begin{lem}\label{lemfinx}[Finite time stability]
If $r$ satisfies Assumption \ref{asst1}, then
\be\label{finitex}
\norm{x(t)}  \leq  \norm{e(0)} \exp \left( a_\theta t \right) + \frac{\norm b r_0}{a_\theta}\left ( \exp(a_\theta t) - 1 \right ),\quad t\geq0
