Let $\bv=(v_1,\dots,v_n)\in H^n$ and $E\subseteq H$. Then $Cb(tp(\bv/E)):=\{(P_Ev_1,\dots,P_Ev_n)\}$ is a canonical base for the type $tp(\bv/E)$.
