[\phi^{-1}(C_{n-1})\cdot\phi^{-n}(U):\phi^{-n}(U)]&=[C_{n-1}\cdot\phi^{-n+1}(U):\phi^{-n+1}(U)]=\\&=[C_{n-1}:C_{n-1}\cap \phi^{-n+1}(U)]=[C_{n-1}:{C_n}].
