0&3S+1\leq s
\end{cases}
\end{equation}
(noting the corresponding neck $[0,6S]\times S^1\subseteq C_\alpha$); this definition also applies over the main ends, with the obvious adjustment for negative main ends.

We define a map:
\begin{equation}
Q_{\alpha,w,y}:W^{k-1,2,\delta,\delta}(\tilde C_\alpha,\Omega^{0,1}_{\tilde C_\alpha,j_y}\otimes_\mathbb C u_\alpha^\ast TM_{J(\ell_{\alpha,w}(A_y(\cdot)))})\to W^{k,2,\delta,\delta}(C_\alpha,u_\alpha^\ast TM)_{D,H}\oplus E
