Recall the long exact sequence \eqref{cechmappingconeles} and apply Lemma \ref{cechlocalglobalvanishingcomplex} to the mapping cone $[\mathcal F^\bullet\to\mathcal G^{\bullet-1}]$.

For any $K\subseteq X$, we have a commutative diagram:
