		\item The geometric morphism $\Sh(F):\Sh({\cal D}, K)\to \Sh({\cal C}, J)$ is an equivalence.

		\item $l'\circ F:({\cal C}, J)\to (a_{K}({\cal D}), C_{K}^{\cal D})$ is a dense morphism of sites.

