\label{corhyperconnectedsieves}
	Let $({\cal C}, J)$ be a small-generated site. Then the full subcategory of $\Sh({\cal C}, J)$ on the objects of the form $a_{J}(S)$ for $c\in {\cal C}$ and $S$ a ($J$-closed) sieve on $c$ is equivalent to the category ${\cal C}_{J}^{s}$ defined as follows: 
